OL,3,GNEWSANatureScot denies ignoring
OL,4,Ascientific evidence in banning guga
OL,5,Ahunt
OL,6,
OL,7,FScotland's nature agency has denied
OL,8,Fignoring scientific evidence after
OL,9,Frefusing a licence for the killing of
OL,10,Fhundreds of young seabirds on a
OL,11,FHebridean island.
OL,13,FNatureScot rejected the application
OL,14,Fthis year for the annual Guga hunt on
OL,15,FSula Sgeir - an uninhabited rocky
OL,16,Fisland 40 miles (64km) north of Ness on
OL,17,FLewis.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
