OL,3,GNEWSANatureScot denies ignoring
OL,4,Ascientific evidence in banning guga
OL,5,Ahunt
OL,6,
OL,7,FWestern Isles MP Torcuil Crichton said
OL,8,Fa report showed there was a debate
OL,9,Fwithin the agency about the "scientific
OL,10,Fconclusion" just two weeks before the
OL,11,Fdecision.
OL,13,FBut NatureScot said "all available
OL,14,Finformation" and legal obligations had
OL,15,Fbeen considered over concerns about the
OL,16,Fimpact on the gannet population.
